{"title":"Watch Your Step","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>The western approach has coral snakes in the grass, and Bram is running out of people willing to walk it.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"bram-fen\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Medium</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p>Nothing to bring in the steps recorded so far.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Imp Tree)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"31|48|Bram Fen\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Check the snake ground west of Binxonia <span class=\"muted\">at -89, 14</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-89|14|Check the snake ground west of Binxonia\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">Kill 6 small coral snakes west of Binxonia <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span></li><li value=\"4\">Report back to Bram Fen <span class=\"muted\">at 31, 48</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"31|48|Report back to Bram Fen\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>120</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>3,500</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/health-potion-small\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/8bf96652c9d8d6a71818.svg\" alt=\"\">Health Potion Small</a> ×3</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Bram Fen says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Bram Fen:</b> I&#39;ll tell the cutters they can use that path again. Boots on, though. I&#39;m putting that part in writing.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"I&#39;ll tell the cutters they can use that path again. Boots on, though. I&#39;m putting that part in writing.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Watch Your Step</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-watch-your-step\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-watch-your-step\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-watch-your-step\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-watch-your-step\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-watch-your-step\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Bram Fen says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-watch-your-step\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}